### 2. 系统“设置”入口注册（`layout/Library/PreferenceLoader/Preferences/AutoOnlineWallpaper.plist`）
在系统“设置”里注册 `AutoOnlineWallpaper` 入口，点击后加载 `AutoOnlineWallpaperPrefs` 设置面板[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span)[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span)：

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0"><dict>
  <key>entry</key><dict>
    <key>bundle</key><string>AutoOnlineWallpaperPrefs</string>
    <key>cell</key><string>PSLinkCell</string>
    <key>label</key><string>AutoOnlineWallpaper</string>
  </dict>
</dict></plist>
```[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span)

